<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEP" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Sophonie</para>
  <para style="toc1">SOPHONIE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sophonie</para>
  <para style="toc3">So</para>
  <para style="mt1">SOPHONIE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:1"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a ki te vini a Sophonie, fis a Cuschi a, fis a Guedalia, fis a Amaria, fis a Ézéchias, nan tan Josias, fis a Amon an, wa a Juda a.<verse eid="ZEP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:2"/>“Mwen va retire tout bagay nèt sou fas tè a”, deklare SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:7">Jen 6:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEP 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:3"/>Mwen va retire ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:11">És 6:11</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 6:12">12</ref></char></note>lòm, ni bèt. Mwen va retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:25">Jr 4:25</ref> </char></note>zwazo syèl yo ak pwason lanmè yo, ansanm ak pil fatra yo ak moun mechan yo. Mwen va koupe retire lòm soti sou fas tè a, deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="ZEP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:4"/>Konsa Mwen va lonje men M kont Juda e kont tout sila ki rete Jérusalem yo. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:13">Mi 5:13</ref></char></note>koupe retire retay a Baal la nan plas sa a ak non a tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:5">II Wa 23:5</ref> </char></note>prèt zidòl yo, <verse eid="ZEP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:5"/>sila ki adore sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:12">II Wa 23:12</ref> </char></note>twati kay, lame syèl yo, sila ki adore yo ki fè sèman pa SENYÈ a, e ki an menm tan, fè sèman pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:5">I Wa 11:5</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 11:23">23</ref></char></note>Milcom, <verse eid="ZEP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:6"/>sila ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:4">És 1:4</ref></char></note>vire fè bak pou yo pa swiv SENYÈ yo, ak sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:13">És 9:13</ref> </char></note>pa t ni chache ni mande pou SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="ZEP 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:7"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:20">Hab 2:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fè silans devan Senyè BONDYE a! Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 1:14">So 1:14</ref> </char></note>jou SENYÈ a pre rive. Paske Bondye te prepare yon sakrifis. Li te konsakre envite Li yo. <verse eid="ZEP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:8"/>Li va vin rive nan jou sakrifis SENYÈ a, ke mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 24:21">És 24:21</ref></char></note>pini prens yo, fis a wa yo, ak tout sila ki abiye ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:6">És 2:6</ref> </char></note>vètman etranje yo. <verse eid="ZEP 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:9"/>Mwen va pini nan jou sa a tout sila ki sote anlè papòt tanp yo, ki plen kay mèt yo ak vyolans ak desepsyon.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:27">Jr 5:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ZEP 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:10"/>Nan jou sa a, deklare SENYÈ a, va gen son a yon gwo kri soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:14">II Kwo 33:14</ref></char></note>Pòtay Pwason an, yon kri: “Anmwey” soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:22">II Kwo 34:22</ref> </char></note>dezyèm katye a, ak yon gwo bri eklatman soti nan kolin yo. <verse eid="ZEP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:11"/>Rele “Anmwey!”, O nou menm k ap viv Macthesch. Paske tout pèp <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:5">So 2:5</ref> </char></note>Canaran an va pe bouch yo nèt. Tout sila ki chaje avèk ajan yo va vin koupe retire nèt. <verse eid="ZEP 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:12"/>Li va vin rive nan lè sa a ke Mwen va chache tout Jérusalem ak lanp, e mwen va pini moun ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:11">Jr 48:11</ref></char></note>deside sou sa yo fin bwe, k ap di nan kè yo: “SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 8:12">Éz 8:12</ref> </char></note>p ap fè byen, ni Li p ap fè mal!” <verse eid="ZEP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:13"/>Konsa, richès yo va tounen piyaj e lakay yo va vin devaste. Wi, yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:11">Am 5:11</ref> </char></note>bati kay, men yo p ap rete ladan yo. Yo va plante chan rezen, men yo p ap bwè diven yo.<verse eid="ZEP 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:14"/>Pre rive se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:7">Jr 30:7</ref></char></note>gran <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:7-12">Éz 7:7-12</ref> </char></note>jou SENYÈ a, pre rive, e l ap pwoche byen vit. Koute vwa a, jou a SENYÈ a! Nan jou sa a, gèrye a va kriye amè. <verse eid="ZEP 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:15"/>Jou sa a se yon jou kòlè ak chalè, yon jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:5">És 22:5</ref></char></note>gwo twoub ak rele anmwey, yon jou destriksyon ak dezolasyon, yon jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:2">Jl 2:2</ref>,<ref loc="JOL 2:31">31</ref> </char></note>tenèb ak dekourajman, youn jou nwaj yo ak gwo fènwa a. <verse eid="ZEP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:16"/>Yon jou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:13">És 27:13</ref> </char></note>twonpèt ak kri batay kont vil fòtifye yo, e kont gwo ranpa yo. <verse eid="ZEP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:17"/>Mwen va mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:18">Jr 10:18</ref></char></note>gwo pwoblèm sou lezòm, pou yo vin mache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:29">Det 28:29</ref> </char></note>tankou moun avèg, akoz yo te peche kont SENYÈ a. Konsa, san yo va vide tankou pousyè e chè yo kon fimye bèt. <verse eid="ZEP 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 1:18"/>Ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 7:19">Éz 7:19</ref></char></note>ajan yo, ni lò yo p ap kapab delivre yo nan jou jijman an, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:8">So 3:8</ref> </char></note>tout latè va vin devore nèt pa dife jalouzi Li. Paske Li va mete yon fen, yon fen ki tèrib, a tout moun ki rete sou tè a.<verse eid="ZEP 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEP 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:1"/>Rasanble nou ansanm, wi rasanble nou, O nasyon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 3:3">Jr 3:3</ref> </char></note>ki pa gen wont, <verse eid="ZEP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:2"/>avan dekrè a vini— avan jou pase tankou pay vannen —avan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:11">Lam 4:11</ref></char></note>chalè vyolan SENYÈ a vin rive sou nou, avan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 1:18">So 1:18</ref> </char></note>jou a kòlè SENYÈ a vin rive sou nou. <verse eid="ZEP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 105:4">Sòm 105:4</ref></char></note>Chache SENYÈ a, nou tout ki enb sou tè a, ki te kenbe òdonans li yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:14">Am 5:14</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 5:15">15</ref> </char></note>Chache ladwati. Chache imilite. Petèt nou va jwenn pwoteksyon nan jou kòlè SENYÈ a. <verse eid="ZEP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:4"/>Paske Gaza va vin abandone, e Askalon va vin yon kote dezole. Asdod va chase mete deyò nan mitan jounen, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:7">Am 1:7</ref>,<ref loc="AMO 1:8">8</ref> </char></note>Ékron va vin dechouke. <verse eid="ZEP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:5"/>Malè pou sila ki rete kote lanmè yo, nasyon a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:16">Éz 25:16</ref> </char></note>Keretyen yo! Pawòl SENYÈ a kont ou, O Canaran, peyi Filisten yo! Mwen va detwi nou jiskaske pa gen moun ki rete la ankò. <verse eid="ZEP 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:6"/>Konsa bò kot lanmè a va tounen patiraj pou bèt, avèk kay pou bèje e pak pou bann mouton yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:17">És 5:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ZEP 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:7"/>Epi kot lanmè a va apatyen a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:16">És 11:16</ref></char></note>retay lakay Juda a. Yo va fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:14">És 32:14</ref> </char></note>patiraj yo sou li. Nan kay Askalon yo, yo va kouche nan aswè; paske SENYÈ Bondye yo a va pran swen yo e restore davni yo. <verse eid="ZEP 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:8"/>Mwen te tande lè Moab t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:8">Éz 25:8</ref></char></note>vekse nou. Ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 25:3">Éz 25:3</ref> </char></note>malediksyon a fis Ammon yo, ke yo t ap vekse pèp Mwen an, e te fè tèt yo vin plen ògèy kont lizyè pa yo a. <verse eid="ZEP 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:9"/>Akoz sa, jan Mwen vivan an, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye Israël la, “Anverite, Moab va vin tankou Sodome e fis a Ammon yo tankou Gomorrhe— yon kote plen pikan, yon twou plen sèl, yon kote devaste nèt. Retay a pèp Mwen an va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:14">És 11:14</ref> </char></note>piyaje yo, e sila ki rete nan nasyon Mwen an, va eritye yo.” <verse eid="ZEP 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:10"/>Se sa yo va twouve kon rekonpans <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 16:6">És 16:6</ref></char></note>ògèy yo, akoz yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:8">So 2:8</ref> </char></note>vekse, e te vin awogan kont pèp a SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="ZEP 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:11"/>SENYÈ a va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:11">Jl 2:11</ref></char></note>tèrib pou yo, paske Li va fè tout dye teritwa yo mouri ak grangou. Konsa, tout moun, depi nan nasyon yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:8-11">Sòm 72:8-11</ref> </char></note>adore Li, yo chak nan pwòp plas yo.<verse eid="ZEP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:12"/>Nou menm tou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 18:1-7">És 18:1-7</ref> </char></note>Etyopyen yo, nou va detwi pa nepe Mwen.<verse eid="ZEP 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:13"/>Li va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:26">És 14:26</ref> </char></note>lonje men Li kont nò pou detwi Assyrie, e li va fè Ninive vin yon kote dezole, sèk tankou dezè. <verse eid="ZEP 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:14"/>Bann bèt sovaj va vin kouche nan mitan l, tout kalite bèt yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:23">És 14:23</ref> </char></note>Grangozye, ni zagoudi va vin rete sou gran vil li yo. Vwa yo va chante nan fenèt yo. Papòt yo va rete dezole, paske Li te devwale nèt tout gran travès bwa sèd yo. <verse eid="ZEP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 2:15"/>Sa se gwo vil ki plen ak kè kontan, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 32:9">És 32:9</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 32:11">11</ref> </char></note> te viv san refleshi. Li te di nan kè l: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:8">És 47:8</ref> </char></note>“Se Mwen, e nanpwen sòf ke mwen.” Ala dezole li vin dezole! Yon kote pou bèt repoze yo. Tout moun ki pase kote l va soufle kon koulèv, e va voye pwen mare yo anlè sou li.<verse eid="ZEP 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEP 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:1"/>Malè a sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:23">Jr 5:23</ref></char></note>fè rebèl e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 23:30">Éz 23:30</ref> </char></note>vin souye a; vil k ap oprime tout! <verse eid="ZEP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:2"/>Fi sa ki pa t obeyi a okenn vwa a. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:30">Jr 2:30</ref></char></note>pa t dakò resevwa enstriksyon. Li pa t mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:22">Sòm 78:22</ref> </char></note>konfyans nan SENYÈ a. Li pa t rapwoche de Bondye li a.<verse eid="ZEP 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 22:27">Éz 22:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Prens anndan li yo tankou lyon voras. Jij li yo tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:6">Jr 5:6</ref> </char></note>lou nan aswè. Yo p ap kite anyen rete pou maten. <verse eid="ZEP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:4"/>Pwofèt li yo se moun trèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:4">Jij 9:4</ref></char></note>san prensip. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 22:26">Éz 22:26</ref> </char></note>Prèt li yo te souye sanktyè a. Yo te fè vyolans a lalwa. <verse eid="ZEP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:5"/>SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:4">Det 32:4</ref></char></note>plen ladwati nan mitan li. Li p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 92:15">Sòm 92:15</ref> </char></note>fè okenn enjistis. Chak maten Li fè jistis pa li vin parèt nan limyè. Li pa janm pa reyisi, men moun enjis yo pa gen wont menm.<verse eid="ZEP 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:6"/>Mwen te detwi nasyon yo. Ranpa yo dezole nèt. Ri yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:12">Jr 9:12</ref></char></note>gate, pou pèsòn moun pa pase. Vil yo fin detwi nèt, pou pa gen moun, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:5">So 2:5</ref> </char></note>pou pa gen pèsòn ki rete ladan yo. <verse eid="ZEP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:7"/>Mwen te di: “Sèlman gen lakrent Mwen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 36:10">Job 36:10</ref> </char></note>Resevwa enstriksyon”. Konsa, kote nou rete a pa p vin koupe retire nèt, selon tout sa ke Mwen te deziye pou rive l. Men yo te leve bonè e te konwonpi nan tout zèv yo.<verse eid="ZEP 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:8"/>“Akoz sa, tann Mwen, deklare SENYÈ a, jis rive jou ke M leve pran piyaj la. Anverite, se desizyon Mwen pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:14-23">Éz 38:14-23</ref></char></note>rasanble nasyon yo, pou mete wayòm yo ansanm, pou M ka vide sou yo tout chalè kòlè Mwen, tout kòlè vyolan Mwen an. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 1:18">So 1:18</ref> </char></note>tout tè a va vin devore avèk dife jalouzi Mwen an.<verse eid="ZEP 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:9"/>Paske nan lè sa a, Mwen va bay a pèp nasyon yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:18">És 19:18</ref> </char></note>lèv ki pirifye, pou yo tout ka rele non SENYÈ a, pou sèvi Li de zepòl a zepòl. <verse eid="ZEP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:10"/>Soti byen lwen rivyè Ethiopie yo, moun ki adore Mwen yo, menm fi dispèse Mwen an va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:6">És 60:6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 60:7">7</ref> </char></note>pote ofrann ban Mwen. <verse eid="ZEP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:11"/>Nan jou sa a, ou p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:17">És 45:17</ref></char></note>vin gen okenn wont pou zak avèk sila ou te fè rebèl kont Mwen yo; paske nan lè sa a Mwen va retire nan mitan nou, sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:12">És 2:12</ref> </char></note>plen ak ògèy nou yo. Konsa, nou p ap janm vin awogan ankò sou mòn sen Mwen an. <verse eid="ZEP 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:12"/>Men Mwen va kite pami nou yon pèp ki aflije, ki malere, e yo va chache pwoteksyon yo nan non SENYÈ a.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:30">És 14:30</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:10">És 50:10</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ZEP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:13"/>Retay Israël la p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:3">Sòm 119:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:3">Za 8:3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 8:16">16</ref> </char></note>fè okenn inikite, ni yo p ap bay manti, ni yon lang twonpe moun p ap twouve nan bouch yo. Paske yo va manje, e kouche, e pèsòn moun p ap fè yo pè.”<verse eid="ZEP 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:14"/>Chante, O fi a Sion an! Rele fò, O Israël! Se pou ou kontan e rejwi ak tout kè ou, O fi Jérusalem nan! <verse eid="ZEP 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:15"/>SENYÈ a te retire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:9">Sòm 19:9</ref></char></note>jijman ou yo. Li te chase tout ènmi ou yo. Wa Israël la, SENYÈ a, la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:26-28">Éz 37:26-28</ref> </char></note>nan mitan nou. Ou pa gen pou pè gwo dega ankò. <verse eid="ZEP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:16"/>Nan jou sa a, sa va di a Jérusalem: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:3">És 35:3</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 35:4">4</ref></char></note>Pa pè anyen, O Sion! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:3">Job 4:3</ref> </char></note>Pa kite men ou vin fèb. <verse eid="ZEP 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:17"/>SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a nan mitan ou; yon plen pwisans ki va sove a. Li va rejwi sou ou avèk jwa. Li va fè ou vin kalm ak lanmou Li. Li va chante fè fèt lajwa sou ou. <verse eid="ZEP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:18"/>Mwen va retire de nou sa yo ki gen chagren <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 42:2-4">Sòm 42:2-4</ref> </char></note>pou fèt deziye yo. Se yon repwoch yo ye pou ou. <verse eid="ZEP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:19"/>Gade byen, nan lè sa a, Mwen va regle ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:14">És 60:14</ref></char></note>tout sila k ap oprime ou yo. Mwen va sove sila ki bwate yo, e rasanble sila ki te rejte yo. M ap bay lwanj ak lonè a sa yo ki p at gen plis ke wont sou tout latè. <verse eid="ZEP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEP 3:20"/>Nan lè sa a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:12">Éz 37:12</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 37:21">21</ref></char></note>fè nou antre e nan menm lè sa a, Mwen va rasanble nou ansanm. Anverite, mwen va bannou lonè ak lwanj pami tout nasyon pèp sou latè yo, lè Mwen mennen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 29:14">Jr 29:14</ref> </char></note> retounen tout bonè nou devan zye nou, pale SENYÈ a.<verse eid="ZEP 3:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEP 3"/>
</usx>
